import ../../../testing/driver.dl
import ../../../ui/source_tools.dl

document editors:
    editor "Studio" containing "get" using no UI appearance
    editor "River" containing "row" using no UI appearance

to [answer navigation query] {a pointer to UI source query:query} [with] {a pointer to JSON value:result}:
    free query's result
    set query's result to result
    set query's queued to false
    set query's ready to true

set instance to an instance of editors
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 900 by 600 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
enable UI source tools for workspace in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set labels to ["Studio", "River"]
set index to 0
loop while index < the length of labels:
    set editor to the UI source editor labeled (the item at index in labels) in workspace
    set main to editor's document
    set files to a new JSON-RPC object
    configure UI source document main named "main.dl" at "file:///workspace/main.dl" prefixed by "# context\n\n" using UI CPU analysis with files files
    free files
    restore UI source location (editor's current) in editor in (the address of view)
    set view's selection's anchor and view's selection's caret to 3
    queue UI input of kind 3 key 301 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
    process UI input in (the address of view)
    set navigation to the address of (workspace's tools' navigation)
    set query to navigation's query
    require condition ((navigation's phase = 1) and (query's method = "textDocument/definition")) reporting "F12 did not request a shared source definition."
    require condition ((the JSON number named "line" in (the JSON member named "position" in (query's parameters))) = 2.0) reporting "The definition request ignored the hidden source prefix."
    answer navigation query query with (a JSON object containing [JSON text "uri" is "file:///lib/helper.dl", JSON child "range" is (an LSP range from line 1 and character 0 to line 1 and character 1)])
    update UI source tools in workspace
    require condition ((navigation's phase = 2) and (navigation's query's method = "dynlex/readDocument")) reporting "An imported definition did not request its source."
    require condition ((the JSON text named "uri" in (navigation's query's parameters)) = "file:///lib/helper.dl") reporting "The source request used the originating document URI."
    answer navigation query (navigation's query) with (JSON text "" is "# helper\nπ means: 7")'s value
    update UI source tools in workspace
    set imported to editor's document
    require condition ((imported != main) and ((imported's filename = "helper.dl") and (imported's project = main's project))) reporting "Definition navigation did not retain its imported source in the project."
    require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 9) and (view's selection's caret = 11)) reporting "Imported definition navigation did not convert UTF-16 to UTF-8."
    require condition ((the UI element (editor's node) accepts edits in window) = false) reporting "An imported definition was writable."
    queue UI input of kind 3 key 301 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
    process UI input in (the address of view)
    require condition ((navigation's phase = 1) and (navigation's document = imported)) reporting "Read-only imported sources could not navigate to another definition."
    answer navigation query (navigation's query) with (a JSON object containing [JSON text "uri" is (main's uri), JSON child "range" is (an LSP range from line 2 and character 0 to line 2 and character 3)])
    update UI source tools in workspace
    require condition ((editor's document = main) and (navigation's phase = 0)) reporting "An already loaded definition required another readDocument request."
    require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 0) and (view's selection's caret = 3)) reporting "Returning to a prefixed main source selected its hidden context."
    queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 4 containing "" in (the address of view)
    process UI input in (the address of view)
    require condition (editor's document = imported) reporting "Alt+Left did not restore the preceding imported definition."
    queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 4 containing "" in (the address of view)
    process UI input in (the address of view)
    require condition ((editor's document = main) and (view's selection's caret = 3)) reporting "Alt+Left did not restore the original source location."
    queue UI input of kind 3 key 301 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
    process UI input in (the address of view)
    set query to navigation's query
    set UI text of (editor's node) in window to "edited"
    synchronize UI source workspace workspace at 2.0 seconds
    answer navigation query query with (a JSON object containing [JSON text "uri" is (imported's uri), JSON child "range" is (an LSP range from line 1 and character 0 to line 1 and character 1)])
    update UI source tools in workspace
    require condition ((navigation's phase = 0) and (editor's document = main)) reporting "A stale definition reply changed the active document after an edit."
    increment index
free UI source workspace workspace
close the address of view
close window
print line "Studio and embedded editors share asynchronous definitions, imported sources, Unicode locations and navigation history."
